 "notes": [
  "Designed for a 1-kanal (50x90 ft) plot in Spanish style matching the concept elevation: left double-arched car porch, central arched entrance and upper loggia, and right-side paired arched windows.",
  "Ground floor coverage is within the 65% LDA limit, providing a drawing room, dining, central lounge separated from the entrance lobby by double doors for purdah, kitchen with glazed door and window to its light patio, dirty kitchen, prayer room ventilated via the patio, servant quarter with attached bath, and 2 bedrooms with attached baths.",
  "First floor houses 3 bedrooms, 3 attached baths (each opening directly into its respective bedroom, including the master bath opening directly into the master bedroom), an upper lounge, and a generous rear roof terrace.",
  "The dog-leg stair (7.5x11 ft, start -y) sits in an 8.5x16 ft stair hall with a 5 ft clear landing at the south (+y) end on both floors and exits onto the roof from the side of the mumty.",
  "A concrete water tank rests on the roof slab beside the stair tower, leaving the main roof deck unobstructed for the solar panel array."
 ],
